  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<h2>Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt — the harmony of relaxation and skin care</h2>\n<p>Treat yourself to a true at-home SPA experience with the Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt. It is a perfect blend of natural sea salt and precious nourishing ingredients that helps you unwind after a long day, restore your energy, and leave your skin feeling comfortable and soft.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/sea-salt-02(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2>The natural power of sea salt</h2>\n<p><strong>Sea salt </strong>has long been cherished as a bath ritual essential, thanks to its rich infusion of natural minerals. It helps to relax after physical exertion, promotes the relief of fatigue and tension, and provides a pleasant feeling of lightness and comfort. A warm bath with sea salt creates the perfect conditions for total relaxation and helps to restore inner harmony after an active day.</p>\n<p><strong>The salt crystals</strong> dissolve quickly in water, transforming an ordinary bath into a luxurious body care ritual.<br/>\r\nHemp oil brings special value to the formula. It is an ingredient renowned for its nourishing, softening, and regenerating properties. Rich in essential fatty acids, it helps maintain the skin's natural protective barrier, prevents excessive dryness, and promotes elasticity. After bathing, your skin is left feeling smoother, softer, and well-cared-for.</p>\n<h2> </h2>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/sea-salt-01(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt is perfect </strong>for your daily at-home SPA routine. It helps create a moment of relaxation amid a busy lifestyle, filling your bath with a soothing atmosphere of relaxation and comfort. This product is an excellent choice for those who want to combine effective skin care with enjoyable moments of restoration.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/sea-salt-03(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2>Benefits of Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Natural sea salt rich in beneficial minerals</li>\n<li>Hemp oil helps nourish and soften the skin</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation and recovery after physical activity</li>\n<li>Helps reduce feeling of fatigue and tension</li>\n<li>Maintains a comfortable level of skin hydration </li>\n<li>Creates a soothing at-home SPA experience</li>\n<li>Suitable for regular use</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Who Is It Suitable For?</h2>\n<p>Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt is an excellent choice for those who appreciate natural skincare and want to combine the beneficial properties of sea salt with the softening effects of plant-based oils. Suitable for regular use, it helps transform every bath into a special self-care ritual.</p>\n<h2><br/>\r\nHow to Use</h2>\n<p>Add 100–150 g of bath sea salt to warm water and allow the crystals to dissolve completely. The recommended bath time is 15–20 minutes. After bathing, the skin becomes softer, smoother, and incredibly pleasant to the touch.</p>\n<h2><br/>\r\nYour personal at-home SPA ritual</h2>\n<p>Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Sea Salt is a simple way to treat yourself to moments of relaxation, restoration, and high-quality skincare. Enjoy a warm bath, experience the power of natural ingredients, and allow yourself a true moment of relaxation on any day.</p>\n<p><br/>\r\n </p>\n\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HLR-821Tcn0\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/HLR-821Tcn0</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
